src/ holds only the files Ambxst Robo's public build uses, under their
upstream paths. Upstream's directory for its own mascot is not here: the
imports of it read mascot/<name>, and lib/build.mjs maps them to lib/public/.
All the files are patched for the port:
  - the names the port's code shares with them (state, settings keys, core
    commands, events) say "mascot", and so do the labels and comments that
    named upstream's mascot ("your mascot", "the mascot");
  - upload/canvas.ts: the mascot's body, eyes and slot are cut out, Robo or
    Axenide (lib/robot/upload.ts) draw themselves there;
  - recap/share.ts: the recap image's title and footer are Ambxst Robo's and
    it draws the mascot (lib/public/share.ts);
  - core/bridge.ts: log lines say [ambxst-robo].
tsconfig.json is upstream's windows/tsconfig.json (esbuild reads its
compiler options for these files).
